## 🎨 QUICK WINS (Copy-Paste These!)

### **1. TYPOGRAPHY UPGRADE** (Biggest Impact!)

**File**: [src/layouts/Layout.astro](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/edlove-web/src/layouts/Layout.astro)

**Replace lines 10-13** (Google Fonts link) with:

```html
		<!-- Google Fonts: Premium Typography Combo -->
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;700;900&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
```

**Now update CSS**:

**File**: Create/edit `tailwind.config.cjs` (or [.mjs](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/edlove-web/astro.config.mjs)):

```js
/** @type {import('tailwindcss').Config} */
export default {
  content: ['./src/**/*.{astro,html,js,jsx,md,mdx,svelte,ts,tsx,vue}'],
  theme: {
    extend: {
      fontFamily: {
        'serif': ['Playfair Display', 'Georgia', 'serif'], // Luxury headings
        'sans': ['Inter', 'system-ui', 'sans-serif'],      // Clean body
        'display': ['Space Grotesk', 'sans-serif'],        // Modern accents
      },
    },
  },
  plugins: [],
}
```

**Result**: Instant luxury feel! Playfair Display = expensive & educated!

