### **3. COSMIC TEXT GLOW** (Line 25)

**Replace the "Cosmos" span** with:

```html
        <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text 
                     bg-gradient-to-r from-warmGold via-dawnRose to-cosmicPurple
                     drop-shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,215,0,0.6)]
                     animate-pulse">
          Cosmos
        </span>
```

**Or for custom pulse** (more subtle):

Add to `src/styles/global.css`:

```css
@keyframes cosmic-glow {
  0%, 100% { 
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 15px rgba(255,215,0,0.5)); 
  }
  50% { 
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 30px rgba(255,107,157,0.7)); 
  }
}

.cosmic-text {
  animation: cosmic-glow 3s ease-in-out infinite;
}
```

Then use:
```html
        <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text 
                     bg-gradient-to-r from-warmGold via-dawnRose to-cosmicPurple
                     cosmic-text">
          Cosmos
        </span>
```

