## 🚀 MEDIUM EFFORT (30 min)

### **4. PARALLAX SCROLL** (Depth Effect!)

**File**: `src/components/CinematicBackground.astro`

Add this at the bottom (before closing tag):

```html
<script>
  if (typeof window !== 'undefined') {
    window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
      const scroll = window.pageYOffset;
      const bg = document.querySelector('.cinematic-bg');
      if (bg) {
        bg.style.transform = `translateY(${scroll * 0.3}px)`;
      }
    });
  }
</script>
```

**Give the background a class** if it doesn't have one:

```html
<div class="cinematic-bg absolute inset-0 ...">
  <!-- cosmic background stuff -->
</div>
```

**Effect**: Background moves slower than content = 3D depth! 🌌

