## 💎 POLISH (1 hour - Optional)

### **6. FLOATING PARTICLES**

**File**: Create `src/components/FloatingParticles.astro`:

```astro
<div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none">
  {Array.from({ length: 30 }).map((_, i) => (
    <div 
      key={i}
      class="absolute w-1 h-1 bg-warmGold/20 rounded-full animate-float"
      style={`
        left: ${Math.random() * 100}%;
        top: ${Math.random() * 100}%;
        animation-delay: ${Math.random() * 5}s;
        animation-duration: ${3 + Math.random() * 4}s;
      `}
    />
  ))}
</div>
```

**Add to global.css**:

```css
@keyframes float {
  0%, 100% { 
    transform: translateY(0px); 
    opacity: 0.2;
  }
  50% { 
    transform: translateY(-30px); 
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
}

.animate-float {
  animation: float 5s ease-in-out infinite;
}
```

**Use it** in [index.astro](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/edlove-web/src/pages/index.astro) (inside `<main>`):

```html
<main class="min-h-screen relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center">
  <CinematicBackground />
  <FloatingParticles />
  <!-- rest of content -->
</main>
```

